===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[deposition]] of [[sediment]] over a long period of time by a [[river]]; an alluvial [[layer]].
# Alluvial [[soil]]; specifically, in [[Australia]], [[gold]]-bearing alluvial soil.

====Usage notes====
* {{sense|deposition of sediment}} The noun is normally used in the plural by [[engineer]]s who recover valuable minerals from these layers.

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|alluvium}}

